You can shut off your terminal and the ventilation system at any time

00:10:51.560 --> 00:10:54.540
To decrease the amount of attention you are drawing to yourself.

00:10:55.260 --> 00:11:00.980
Also, shining your light directly into a vent will most likely prevent anything from jumping out.

00:11:01.620 --> 00:11:05.060
You also have three tools available from the terminal itself.

00:11:05.060 --> 00:11:10.260
There is a motion detector, an audio decoy, and a secondary ventilation unit.

00:11:10.800 --> 00:11:16.300
Keep in mind, however, that you can only have one of these active at any given time.

00:11:16.840 --> 00:11:17.740
